<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="description" content="bae is a music library for the albums you own, on your desktop and your phone, synced through cloud storage you already have. No server to keep running. Private, yours." />
<title>bae — Your Music Everywhere</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,600;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style is:global>
  :root{
    --night:#100e1a; --night-2:#161327; --card:#1c1830; --card-2:#231d3a;
    --cream:#fdf5ef; --fg-dim:rgba(253,245,239,.66); --fg-faint:rgba(253,245,239,.4);
    --violet:#9b6cf6; --violet-deep:#7c4ddb;
    --pink:#f7a8c4; --pink-deep:#ec6a99; --mint:#86e0c8;
    --line:rgba(253,245,239,.12);
    --disp:"Bricolage Grotesque",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --body:"Hanken Grotesk",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --mono:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--night);color:var(--cream);font-family:var(--body);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  ::selection{background:var(--pink);color:#3a2230;}
  .wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}

  .r.is-pre{opacity:0;}
  .r.is-in{animation:pop .85s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1);}
  .r.is-in.d1{animation-delay:.08s;} .r.is-in.d2{animation-delay:.16s;} .r.is-in.d3{animation-delay:.24s;} .r.is-in.d4{animation-delay:.32s;}
  @keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px) scale(.985);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.r.is-in{animation:none;}}
  @keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-2deg);}50%{transform:translateY(-16px) rotate(2deg);}}
  @keyframes floaty{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-10px);}}

  /* nav */
  nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(16,14,26,.7);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:border-color .3s;}
  nav.scrolled{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .navin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;height:66px;}
  .brand{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.02em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
  .brand img{width:30px;height:30px;}
  .navlinks{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center;}
  .navlinks a{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--fg-dim);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;}
  .navlinks a:hover{color:var(--cream);}
  .btn{font-family:var(--body);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--cream);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .22s,border-color .22s,color .22s,background .22s,box-shadow .22s;}
  .btn:hover{border-color:var(--pink);color:var(--pink);}
  .btn.solid{background:var(--violet);border-color:var(--violet);color:#fff;}
  .btn.solid:hover{background:var(--violet-deep);border-color:var(--violet-deep);color:#fff;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(155,108,246,.45);}
  .btn.pink{background:var(--pink);border-color:var(--pink);color:#3a2230;}
  .btn.pink:hover{background:var(--pink-deep);border-color:var(--pink-deep);color:#fff;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(236,106,153,.4);}
  .navgh{display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:42px;height:42px;color:var(--fg-dim);transition:color .22s;}
  .navgh:hover{color:var(--cream);}
  .navgh svg{width:22px;height:22px;}
  .navtoggle{display:none;margin-left:auto;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:5px;width:42px;height:42px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;}
  .navtoggle span{display:block;height:2px;width:100%;background:var(--cream);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .25s,opacity .2s;}
  .navtoggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7px) rotate(45deg);}
  .navtoggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2){opacity:0;}
  .navtoggle[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg);}
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .navin{gap:14px;}
    .navlinks{position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;right:0;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:0;margin-left:0;padding:8px 0 16px;background:rgba(16,14,26,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(-8px);transition:opacity .22s,transform .22s,visibility .22s;}
    .navlinks.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none;}
    .navlinks a{padding:13px 28px;font-size:16px;}
    .navlinks a.ghlink{display:none;}
    .navlinks a.btn{margin:12px 28px 4px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;}
    .navgh{display:inline-flex;margin-left:auto;}
    .navtoggle{display:inline-flex;margin-left:0;}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.navtoggle span,.navlinks{transition:none;}}

  /* hero */
  header.hero{padding:130px 0 70px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .blob{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(60px);opacity:.5;pointer-events:none;}
  .blob.v{width:520px;height:520px;background:rgba(155,108,246,.4);left:-120px;top:-40px;}
  .blob.p{width:460px;height:460px;background:rgba(247,168,196,.32);right:-120px;top:80px;}
  .heroin{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:30px;align-items:center;}
  .tagpill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--fg-dim);margin-bottom:24px;}
  .tagpill .led{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--mint);}
  h1.jumbo{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(46px,6.4vw,82px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0;}
  h1.jumbo .pink{color:var(--pink);} h1.jumbo .violet{color:var(--violet);}
  .dek{margin:26px 0 0;font-size:clamp(16px,1.4vw,18.5px);line-height:1.62;color:var(--fg-dim);max-width:48ch;}
  .dek b{color:var(--cream);font-weight:600;}
  .cta{display:flex;gap:13px;margin-top:34px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;}
  .cta .meta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-faint);}

  .herosheep{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;}
  .sheepglow{position:absolute;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(247,168,196,.34),rgba(155,108,246,.18) 50%,transparent 72%);}
  .herosheep img{width:min(100%,400px);position:relative;animation:bob 6s ease-in-out infinite;filter:drop-shadow(0 24px 50px rgba(155,108,246,.4));}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.herosheep img{animation:none;}}
  .note{position:absolute;background:var(--card-2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);animation:floaty 5s ease-in-out infinite;}
  .note .s{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--fg-faint);font-weight:400;margin-top:2px;}
  .note.one{top:8%;left:-6%;} .note.two{bottom:12%;right:-4%;animation-delay:1.2s;}
  .note .dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:6px;}

  .trust{display:flex;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:54px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;}
  .trust .t{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;}
  .trust .t b{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:23px;}
  .trust .t b .a{color:var(--pink);}
  .trust .t span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--fg-faint);}

  /* features */
  .sec{padding:84px 0;}
  .center{text-align:center;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 50px;}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pink);margin-bottom:14px;}
  h2.sech{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,52px);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.02;}
  .center p{font-size:17px;color:var(--fg-dim);line-height:1.6;margin:0;}
  .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;}
  .fcard{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),var(--night-2));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:28px;transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s,box-shadow .3s;}
  .fcard:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:rgba(247,168,196,.5);box-shadow:0 22px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45);}
  .fcard .top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .fcard .emoji{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:15px;display:grid;place-items:center;}
  .fcard .no{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-faint);}
  .fcard h3{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .fcard p{margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--fg-dim);}
  .fcard .tags{margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .fcard .tags span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--card-2);color:var(--fg-faint);letter-spacing:.03em;}
  .fcard.wide{grid-column:1 / -1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;}
  .fcard.wide .emoji{margin-bottom:0;flex:none;width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:17px;}
  .fcard.wide .wtext{flex:1;min-width:0;}
  .fcard.wide h3{margin-bottom:6px;}
  .fcard.wide p{max-width:62ch;}
  .ghbtn{flex:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:var(--cream);padding:12px 20px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);transition:transform .22s,border-color .22s,color .22s,background .22s;}
  .ghbtn:hover{border-color:var(--mint);color:var(--mint);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  @media(max-width:860px){.fcard.wide{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px;}}

  /* encryption */
  .enc{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 0%,rgba(155,108,246,.18),transparent 55%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 92% 100%,rgba(247,168,196,.16),transparent 55%),var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:48px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center;}
  .enc h2{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,42px);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.04;}
  .enc h2 .p{color:var(--pink);}
  .enc p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--fg-dim);margin:0 0 12px;}
  .flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}
  .flownode{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:15px 17px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:var(--night-2);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;}
  .flownode .n{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;}
  .flownode.a .n{background:var(--violet);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--violet);}
  .flownode.b .n{background:var(--pink);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--pink);}
  .flownode.c .n{background:var(--mint);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--mint);}
  .flownode em{font-family:var(--mono);font-style:normal;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--fg-faint);margin-left:auto;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;}

  /* providers */
  .minigrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;}
  .mini{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),var(--night-2));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px;transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s,box-shadow .3s;}
  .mini:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:rgba(247,168,196,.45);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
  .mini .mico{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:15px;}
  .mini h4{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:700;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;}
  .mini p{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--fg-dim);}
  @media(max-width:860px){.minigrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .provwrap{text-align:center;}
  .provrow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px;}
  .pchip{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);transition:transform .25s,border-color .25s,color .25s;}
  .pchip:hover{border-color:var(--pink);color:var(--pink);transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .provnote{margin-top:26px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--fg-faint);max-width:60ch;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.55;}
  .provnote b{color:var(--fg-dim);font-weight:600;}

  /* end */
  .endcta{text-align:center;padding:96px 0;}
  .endcta .ring{width:128px;height:128px;margin:0 auto 26px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(247,168,196,.3),transparent 70%);}
  .endcta .ring img{width:118px;animation:bob 6s ease-in-out infinite;}
  .endcta h2{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(36px,5.2vw,68px);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;margin:0 0 16px;}
  .endcta h2 .pink{color:var(--pink);} .endcta h2 .violet{color:var(--violet);}
  .endcta p{font-size:17px;color:var(--fg-dim);margin:0 0 30px;}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:42px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  footer .fb{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
  footer .fb img{width:26px;height:26px;}
  footer .links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  footer a{font-size:14px;color:var(--fg-dim);font-weight:500;} footer a:hover{color:var(--pink);}
  footer .cp{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--fg-faint);}

  @media(max-width:860px){.heroin{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.herosheep{order:-1;}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.enc{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:32px;}}
  @media(max-width:560px){
    .trust{flex-direction:column;gap:13px;margin-top:40px;}
    .trust .t{flex-direction:row;align-items:baseline;justify-content:center;gap:9px;}
    .trust .t b{font-size:20px;}
    .trust .t span{font-size:13px;color:var(--fg-dim);}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav id="nav"><div class="wrap navin">
  <span class="brand"><img src="/app-icon.png" alt="" />bae</span>
  <a class="navgh" href="https://github.com/bae-fm/bae" aria-label="GitHub"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.58 2 12.25c0 4.53 2.87 8.37 6.84 9.73.5.1.68-.22.68-.49l-.01-1.9c-2.78.62-3.37-1.2-3.37-1.2-.45-1.18-1.11-1.49-1.11-1.49-.91-.64.07-.62.07-.62 1 .07 1.53 1.06 1.53 1.06.9 1.56 2.36 1.11 2.93.85.09-.66.35-1.11.63-1.37-2.22-.26-4.56-1.14-4.56-5.07 0-1.12.39-2.03 1.03-2.75-.1-.26-.45-1.3.1-2.71 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.05A9.4 9.4 0 0 1 12 6.84c.85 0 1.71.12 2.51.34 1.91-1.32 2.75-1.05 2.75-1.05.55 1.41.2 2.45.1 2.71.64.72 1.03 1.63 1.03 2.75 0 3.94-2.34 4.81-4.57 5.06.36.32.68.94.68 1.9l-.01 2.81c0 .27.18.6.69.49A10.02 10.02 0 0 0 22 12.25C22 6.58 17.52 2 12 2z"/></svg></a>
  <button id="navtoggle" class="navtoggle" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navlinks"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  <div class="navlinks" id="navlinks">
    <a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#cloud">No server</a><a href="#enc">Privacy</a><a class="ghlink" href="https://github.com/bae-fm/bae">GitHub</a>
    <a class="btn pink" href="#get">Download</a>
  </div>
</div></nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="blob v"></div><div class="blob p"></div>
  <div class="wrap heroin">
    <div>
      <div class="tagpill r"><span class="led"></span> The music you own, on every device</div>
      <h1 class="jumbo r d1">Your music<br/><span class="pink">everywhere</span></h1>
      <p class="dek r d2">Every album you own, on your desktop and your phone. Listen everywhere, synced effortlessly. No server to keep running. <b style="white-space:nowrap;">Private, yours.</b></p>
      <div class="cta r d3">
        <a class="btn pink" href="https://github.com/bae-fm/bae/releases/latest/download/bae-macos.dmg">Download for macOS</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#features">Explore features</a>
        <span class="meta">macOS · iOS · Windows · Android</span>
      </div>
      <div class="trust r d3">
        <div class="t"><b>Yours<span class="a">.</span></b><span>to keep, for good</span></div>
        <div class="t"><b>Everywhere<span class="a">.</span></b><span>always in sync</span></div>
        <div class="t"><b>Serverless<span class="a">.</span></b><span>no server to run</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="herosheep r d2">
      <div class="sheepglow"></div>
      <img src="/sheep.png" alt="bae the sheep, wearing headphones" />
      <div class="note one"><span class="dot" style="background:#32d74b"></span>Synced<span class="s">4 minutes ago</span></div>
      <div class="note two">Neon Frequencies<span class="s">The Midnight Signal · 3:42</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="sec" id="features"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="center r">
    <div class="eyebrow">What you get</div>
    <h2 class="sech">Your whole collection,<br/>finally in order.</h2>
    <p>Bring the albums you already own into one good-looking library, and take it everywhere you go.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="fcard r">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(155,108,246,.18);color:var(--violet)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.9a2 2 0 0 1-1.69-.9L9.6 3.9A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2z"/><path d="M12 10v6m-2.5-2.5L12 16l2.5-2.5"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">01</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Everything in one place</h3>
      <p>Add the music you already have, ripped CDs, downloads, Bandcamp buys, and bae matches each album to the right release for spot-on track names, cover art, and credits.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>MusicBrainz &amp; Discogs</span><span>Cover art</span><span>Release-accurate</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard r d1">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(247,168,196,.2);color:var(--pink-deep)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">02</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Sounds the way it should</h3>
      <p>Whole albums play start to finish the way the artist meant them, gapless, with FLAC, CUE sheets, and vinyl side breaks all handled right.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>FLAC &amp; CUE</span><span>Gapless</span><span>Vinyl side breaks</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard r">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(134,224,200,.18);color:var(--mint)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 15-6.7L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-15 6.7L3 16"/><path d="M3 21v-5h5"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">03</span>
      </div>
      <h3>On all your devices</h3>
      <p>Start on your desktop and keep listening on your phone. Your library looks the same everywhere, updates on its own, and plays even when you're offline.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>Desktop &amp; phone</span><span>Always in sync</span><span>Works offline</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard r d1">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(155,108,246,.18);color:var(--violet)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 1 0-1.4-8.8A6 6 0 1 0 6 16h11.5z"/></svg></div>
        <span class="no">04</span>
      </div>
      <h3>Yours for good</h3>
      <p>Your music stays in normal files that you control, keep them, move them, back them up. Nobody can take your collection away or change the deal.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>You own the files</span><span>Yours to keep</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard wide r d2">
      <div class="emoji" style="background:rgba(134,224,200,.18);color:var(--mint)"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3v12"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9"/></svg></div>
      <div class="wtext">
        <h3>Open source, all the way down</h3>
        <p>The whole app is free and open source. See exactly how your music is handled, suggest a change, or build your own thing on top of it. It's all out in the open.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span>Free &amp; open source</span><span>Built in the open</span></div>
